Write .github/workflows/android-doctor.yml, pinned to this version, running on pull requests

Usage: android-doctor ci install [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --dir <DIR>            Project root to write into [default: .]
      --no-color             Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
      --print                Print the workflow and write nothing
      --force                Replace an existing workflow file instead of refusing
      --path <FIRMWARE_DIR>  Firmware directory to scan, relative to the repository root [default: firmware]
      --fail-on <LEVEL>      Minimum severity that fails the job [default: critical] [possible values: critical, high, medium, low, none, error, warn]
  -h, --help                 Print help
